# What the jantar-fleet-test image leaves out of the repo (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile). Above all the host's
# node_modules and dist: the image installs and builds its own, for Linux.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-test
**/.vite
**/.vitest
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
**/.jantar-test-*
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
.git
site
.secrets-denylist.local
.env
.env.*
docs/research
docs/design-brief.md
docs/v*-notes.md
